<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109520" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποφορ-ά</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποφέρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>carrying off below, purging,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Coac.</u>
				304
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				511
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				44.8.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>draining off,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.58
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>putting forward,</i> by way of excuse, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῶν μηνῶν ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					5.1.29
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Rhet., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ τοῦ ἐχθροῦ λόγος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Inv.</u>
				3.4
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				13
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Tib.
				<u>Fig.</u>
				39
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>drain,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gp.
				2.6.8
			</span></i>, v. l. in <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				1.29.40
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> in <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				5.4.9
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποφοράς</span> is the true reading
				(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπ-</span> codd. plerique).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
